       "title": "Find the exact value of \\arcsin\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right).",
       "tool": "inverse-trig-graphs",
       "level": "level1",
       "purpose": "practice",
       "format": "open",
       "question": [
        "Find the exact value of $\\arcsin\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)$."
       ],
       "answer": [
        "$-\\frac{\\pi}{6}$"
       ],
       "explanation": [
        "Sketch $y = \\sin x$ between $-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ and $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$. It has half-turn symmetry about the origin.",
        "So $\\sin\\left(-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) = -\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{6} = -\\frac{1}{2}$.",
        "$\\arcsin\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) = -\\frac{\\pi}{6}$"
       ],
