       "id": "it-ex-3",
       "title": "Find the exact value of \\arccos\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right).",
       "tool": "inverse-trig-graphs",
       "level": "level1",
       "purpose": "practice",
       "format": "open",
       "question": [
        "Find the exact value of $\\arccos\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)$."
       ],
       "answer": [
        "$\\frac{2\\pi}{3}$"
       ],
       "explanation": [
        "Sketch $y = \\cos x$ between $0$ and $\\pi$: only angles from $0$ to $\\pi$, so the answer cannot be negative.",
        "The curve has half-turn symmetry about $\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}, 0\\right)$, so $\\cos(\\pi - \\theta) = -\\cos\\theta$.",
        "$\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3} = \\frac{1}{2}$, so $\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}{3} = -\\frac{1}{2}$ and $\\arccos\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right) = \\frac{2\\pi}{3}$"
       ],
